# Hypertaks Plugin for Pi

## Install

```bash
pi install https://github.com/aabrur/hypertaks-agent.git
```

## Update and uninstall

```bash
pi update hypertaks
pi remove hypertaks
```

The package exposes the tracked Pi extension and exactly five canonical Hypertaks skills.

## Compatibility

